WEBVTT

00:09:28.239 --> 00:09:30.842
(Laughter)

00:09:31.587 --> 00:09:36.311
I know some people who got tenure
in that place with lies like that.

00:09:36.335 --> 00:09:39.079
(Laughter)

00:09:39.103 --> 00:09:41.889
(Laughter and applause)

00:09:41.913 --> 00:09:44.280
So I was one of their failures.

00:09:45.296 --> 00:09:46.759
But it wasn't that simple,

00:09:46.783 --> 00:09:49.070
because by the time
I got out of that unit,

00:09:49.094 --> 00:09:51.517
I was not functional at all.

00:09:51.541 --> 00:09:54.369
I could hardly see five feet
in front of myself.

00:09:54.803 --> 00:09:57.795
I shuffled when I walked.
I was bowed over.

00:09:57.819 --> 00:09:59.282
I rarely bathed.

00:09:59.306 --> 00:10:00.924
I sometimes didn't shave.